: "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:42:08Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "It caused backlash after a parent going to pick up the kid from school was detained for 30 minutes. iiRC\nAnd subsequently withdrawn", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:42:28Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "glad to hear that. i am a firm believer that streets are for people.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:42:54Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "people should have first priority on streets, not cars. highways are a different matter.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:43:49Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "next", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:43:52Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "This was nearly 20 years back. It was for any form on pedestrian “interference”. Now it’s I think only in major intersection for crossing when vehicular traffic is on", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:44:03Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "3.\tIn July 1876, Sandford Fleming, a Scottish-born Canadian engineer arrived at a railway station in Bandoran, Ireland, and discovered that the train he had planned to catch had left twelve hours earlier. The printed timetable had said \"5:35,\" but had not specified a.m. or p.m. Furious at the loss of a day, he came up with a comprehensive solution that would prevent such problems around the world. He then spent much of the next decade as a one-man global lobbyist, writing pamphlets and traveling the world arguing for a single solution. His proposal to establish X was substantially adopted at the International Y Conference held in Washington, D.C. in 1884. ID X (5 points) and Y (5 points).", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:44:14Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Time zone", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:44:23Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "GMT ?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:44:25Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "Meridian", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:44:29Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "Standard time", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:44:30Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "24 hour time", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:44:38Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Answers: X=time zones, Y=Meridian", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:44:56Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "The guy ran into one problem (12-hour vs. 24-hour) but ended up solving a whole class of problems", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:45:13Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "Didn’t know the context. Lurn", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:45:24Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Vats: 10, Akshay: 15, Saumay: 5", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:45:29Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Overachieving Gokhale", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]